a" aria-labelledby="media-title">\n      <header class="candidate-section-head"><div class="candidate-section-title-row"><h2 id="media-title">MEDIA PULSE &amp; COVERAGE</h2><span class="candidate-section-info-wrap"><button class="candidate-section-info" type="button" aria-label="Section context" aria-describedby="media-note">i</button><span class="candidate-section-tooltip" id="media-note" role="tooltip">Visibility in monitored coverage: volume, publishers, composition and concentration.</span></span></div></header>\n      <div class="candidate-media-grid">\n        <article class="candidate-panel candidate-media-summary"><div class="candidate-panel-head"><div class="candidate-panel-title-row"><h3>MEDIA PULSE</h3><span class="candidate-section-info-wrap candidate-panel-info-wrap"><button class="candidate-section-info" type="button" aria-label="Media Pulse definition" aria-describedby="media-pulse-note">i</button><span class="candidate-section-tooltip" id="media-pulse-note" role="tooltip">Media Pulse measures Marine Le Pen\'s share of associated articles within the election and campaign scopes. It does not measure support, approval, sentiment or voting intention.</span></span></div><span>last 7 published days</span></div><div class="candidate-panel-body"><div class="candidate-media-readout"><strong>8.9%</strong><span>SHARE OF ELECTION + CAMPAIGN COVERAGE</span></div><p>Share of articles associated with Marine Le Pen within the election and campaign scopes.</p><div class="candidate-stat-grid"><div><strong>69</strong><span>articles</span></div><div><strong>30</strong><span>publishers</span></div><div><strong>63</strong><span>story clusters</span></div><div><strong>7</strong><span>active days</span></div></div></div></article>\n        <article class="candidate-panel candidate-chart-panel candidate-media-history-panel"><div class="candidate-panel-head"><div class="candidate-panel-title-row"><h3>RECENT COVERAGE TREND</h3><span class="candidate-section-info-wrap candidate-panel-info-wrap"><button class="candidate-section-info" type="button" aria-label="Recent coverage trend information" aria-describedby="media-history-note">i</button><span class="candidate-section-tooltip" id="media-history-note" role="tooltip">Daily share of election + campaign articles associated with Marine Le Pen. The series covers 29 complete UTC days and does not measure support, approval, sentiment or voting intention.</span></span></div><span>29 complete days · UTC</span></div><div class="candidate-panel-body"><div class="candidate-chart candidate-media-history-chart" data-chart="media-history" role="group" aria-label="Recent history of Marine Le Pen&#x27;s daily coverage share"><p class="candidate-chart-fallback">Published history from 15 Oct 2026 to 12 Nov 2026.</p></div></div></article>\n        <article class="candidate-panel candidate-media-structure-panel"><div class="candidate-panel-head"><h3>COVERAGE STRUCTURE</h3></div><div class="candidate-panel-body"><div class="candidate-media-structure"><section class="candidate-media-structure-module candidate-media-scope-module"><h4>SCOPE</h4><div class="candidate-media-scope-grid"><div class="candidate-media-scope-item candidate-media-scope-election"><div class="candidate-media-scope-head"><span>ELECTION</span><strong>88.4%</strong></div><span class="candidate-media-scope-meta">61 articles</span><span class="candidate-media-structure-track" aria-hidden="true"><span style="--structure-share:0.884"></span></span></div><div class="candidate-media-scope-item candidate-media-scope-campaign"><div class="candidate-media-scope-head"><span>CAMPAIGN</span><strong>11.6%</strong></div><span class="candidate-media-scope-meta">8 articles</span><span class="candidate-media-structure-track" aria-hidden="true"><span style="--structure-share:0.116"></span></span></div></div></section><div class="candidate-media-structure-lower"><section class="candidate-media-structure-module"><h4>MENTION PLACEMENT</h4><div class="candidate-me